/S/Span<</ActualText(\040\040\\begin\040{aligned}\040a\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{1}{|\\mathcal\040{P}_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}|}\\!\\!\\sum\040_{x\040\\in\040\\mathcal\040{P}_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}}\\!\\!\040d\(x,\040\\mathcal\040{G}\),\040&\\quad\040c_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{1}{|\\mathcal\040{G}_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}|}\\!\\!\\sum\040_{y\040\\in\040\\mathcal\040{G}_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}}\\!\\!\040d\(y,\040\\mathcal\040{P}\),\040&\\quad\040c_{\\mathrm\040{all}}\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{1}{|\\mathcal\040{G}|}\\!\\sum\040_{y\040\\in\040\\mathcal\040{G}}\\!\040d\(y,\040\\mathcal\040{P}\),\040\\\\[2pt]\040\\mathrm\040{CD}_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{1}{2}\(a\040+\040c_{\\mathrm\040{vis}}\),\040&\\quad\040\\mathrm\040{CD}_{\\mathrm\040{all}}\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{1}{2}\(a\040+\040c_{\\mathrm\040{all}}\),\040&\\quad\040\\mathrm\040{F}_{\\tau\040}\040&=\040\\tfrac\040{2\040P_{\\tau\040}\040R_{\\tau\040}}{P_{\\tau\040}\040+\040R_{\\tau\040}},\040\\end\040{aligned}\040)>>BDC
